                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "2",
                    "text": "I'ma fax you a copy - and let you know my job ain't sloppy",
                    "rhyme": "i",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "3",
                    "text": "Extort the industry cause Nicky Barnes is gonna be",
                    "rhyme": "ab",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "4",
                    "text": "In charge of every label's distribution",
                    "rhyme": "$",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "5",
                    "text": "My street team is gonna be eight men with loaded tecs",
