                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "6",
                    "text": "Ridin around with Chrysler PT cruisers from a mental institution",
                    "rhyme": "$",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "7",
                    "text": "Whip mob style, Tone Capone AZ in charge of publicity on the phone",
                    "rhyme": "on",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "8",
                    "text": "Crazy Joe outside to meet the mixtape DJ's with carbombs",
                    "rhyme": "$b",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "9",
                    "text": "In the parkin zone - purple Cadillac lavender two-tone",
                    "rhyme": "On",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "10",
                    "text": "A box packed up with a chopped off human head",
                    "rhyme": "Ed",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "11",
                    "text": "With a murdered pitbull with a knife in his stomach",
                    "rhyme": "ak",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "12",
                    "text": "Federal Express to your secret home",
                    "rhyme": "om",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "13",
                    "text": "Sonny D handle the Wherehouse and Tower",
                    "rhyme": "9R",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "14",
                    "text": "Take Coconuts and Sam Goody",
                    "rhyme": "i",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "15",
                    "text": "And hire David Berkowitz as a receptionist for more power",
                    "rhyme": "9R",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "16",
                    "text": "Extreme impact when Uniter Parcel",
                    "rhyme": "El",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "17",
                    "text": "Bring bazookas and bombs in from Iraq",
                    "rhyme": "ak",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "18",
                    "text": "Close the George Washington Bridge when we attack",
                    "rhyme": "ak",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "19",
                    "text": "Carryin duffle bag sacks",
                    "rhyme": "ak",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "20",
                    "text": "Larry Davis is workin with a thirty-eight magnum",
                    "rhyme": "Om",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "21",
                    "text": "Big stations won't have any problem hearin the wax",
                    "rhyme": "aks",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "23",
                    "text": "Sendin the video to HBO and Cinemax",
                    "rhyme": "aks",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                },
                {
                    "n": "24",
                    "text": "Chorus",
                    "rhyme": "ys",
                    "persona": "Kool Keith"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
